The '''Tonalztics of Ralos''' is a one-handed [[Weapons/Categories#Thrown|thrown]] weapon that requires level 75 [[Ranged]] to equip, obtained by participating in the [[Fortis Colosseum]]. Unlike most [[thrown weapons]], it is not stackable and effectively provides unlimited "ammo," though it has an additional effect when charged with [[Sunfire splinter]]s. The weapon rolls against a monster's light ranged defence.

When attacking with the weapon, it hits a target for 0-75% of the player's [[maximum ranged hit]]. When charged, the weapon will [[Multi-hit weapons|hit twice]], with two independent damage rolls and an attack range of 7 tiles (9 on longrange). Uncharged, it will only hit once, and has a slightly worse attack range of 6 tiles (8 on longrange). It can hold a maximum of 20,000 charges. One charge is consumed per throw, whether or not the special attack is used, and regardless of the amount of hits that land. Players can configure the charges while the weapon is in their bank by right-clicking on Configure-Charges, as long as players have the required materials.

